        "date": "2026-11-18T03:15:42Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): support 5-axis and rotary operations in aligned setups\n\nRoute picked drive chains in `selection::drive_chains` through\n`setup_align::pose_in` (passed from `operation::material_region::drive_chains_of`),\nroute `fixture::rotary_axis_of` through `setup_align::facets_in`, and enable\nall ten 5-axis and rotary operations in `setup_align::verified_kind`. Pin all\nten kinds in `crates/app/tests/setup_align_multiaxis.rs` and record the\ndecision in `docs/decisions/2286-aligned-setup-multiaxis.md`.\n\nFixes #2286",
